{"obsah":"<p>Another rainy exhibition by Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Matouš Balík is history. It took some experience to cope with the gravel, pebbles and mud, but the guys went for it to please all the enthusiasts who weren't put off by the rain. The organiser even checked whether it wasn't dangerous to climb on the bike, but after being assured that yes, it's dangerous, but the guys don't care, she gave up. The spectators egged the guys on to a solid 125 cm in the sideways jump, which had to be done instead of the volunteers (nobody would have lain down under the guys in the rain anyway). </p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p>At the same moment Martin Šimůnek and Dominik Budský were battling away at a corporate event in Stará Boleslav. So far we only have photos from the first exhibition, so hopefully Martin will send something.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F0b8af7cd-f0c1-4938-a2eb-70ebd83da826.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F0b8af7cd-f0c1-4938-a2eb-70ebd83da826.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213010\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F3f3fada6-f48f-44f7-9267-48009af46ade.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2F3f3fada6-f48f-44f7-9267-48009af46ade.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-213009\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F10%2